From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mariano Scazzariello <marianoscazzariello@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:03:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Simulator: add kv_transfer_mode=real with native NIXL
 transfers

- simulation_config.kv_transfer_mode: simulated (default) or real
- real mode keeps the native NixlConnector; validated for CPU pull transfers, one rank, dense models
- real mode allocates real KV tensors and zeroes/copies blocks through the native runner
---
